; Eight i8 loads deinterleaved into two 4-wide streams, 28 bytes behind a
; <4 x i8> store, with a loop stride of 16 bytes.

; YAML-LABEL: --- !Passed
; YAML-NEXT:  Pass:            slp-vectorizer
; YAML-NEXT:  Name:            StoresVectorized
; YAML-NEXT:  Function:        stlf_interleaved
; YAML-NEXT:  Args:
